      "content": "look i know you have to say that but honestly i've had stuff like this last week and it went away with just some cream. if it was really serious like cellulitis wouldn't it be way more painful or like, would i have a fever or something? i'm feeling totally fine aside from the warmth. just give me a straight answer—if i use the clotrimazole and it doesn't work in 3 days, is that a sign i actually need a doctor, or should i just try a different cream first?",
